# Source of truth
- The project file is docs/SOURCE_OF_TRUTH.md. Read sections 0 to 7 before working on any ticket.
- Work only on the ticket the prompt names. If no ticket is named, ask which one.
- If code, skills or docs disagree with the file, the file wins. If the file looks wrong, stop and ask.
- Never resolve [OPEN] or [CONFIRM] items. Ask.
- At the end of every ticket update the file in the same branch: status, acceptance checklist, data contracts, endpoint registry, decisions, changelog. Never delete history.
- Do not mark a ticket DONE without evidence for every acceptance item.
- No em dashes.
